WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Hey guys.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.666
How's it going?

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:03.515
Today we are unboxing
something super exciting

00:00:03.515 --> 00:00:06.385
and it is one of my most
favorite things to test out.

00:00:06.385 --> 00:00:10.043
This is the new Mophie XXL USB-C charger.

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:11.808
What's extremely exciting about this one

00:00:11.808 --> 00:00:13.522
is that its USB-C and there's enough power

00:00:13.522 --> 00:00:15.468
in here to charge a MacBook.

00:00:15.468 --> 00:00:17.970
A MacBook that of course
charges with USB-C.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.465
So we're gonna test that
out, see if it works.

00:00:19.465 --> 00:00:22.067
But first, we have to do the unboxing.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:23.642
I can't wait to try this out.

00:00:23.642 --> 00:00:25.392
So, let's open it up.

00:00:26.331 --> 00:00:27.331
Take a look.

00:00:28.476 --> 00:00:29.309
We've got some things,

00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:30.571
the amount of extra battery you'll receive

00:00:30.571 --> 00:00:31.787
depends on a variety of factors

00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:33.241
that are different for every user.

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.879
That is very, very true.

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:36.054
Aaaahhhh.

00:00:36.054 --> 00:00:37.505
Look at this guys.

00:00:37.505 --> 00:00:40.392
Unfortunately, you can't feel
this because it's a video.

00:00:40.392 --> 00:00:41.990
But it is way different
than any of the other

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.316
Mophie's that I've had because

00:00:43.316 --> 00:00:47.940
it feels like a, I don't
even know what to explain.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.568
It's kind of like a felt,
but it's like a weird feel.

00:00:51.568 --> 00:00:52.594
(sniff)

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:53.505
Doesn't have a smell.

00:00:53.505 --> 00:00:55.538
It's interesting because
most of the other Mophie's

00:00:55.538 --> 00:00:57.652
that I have, I've never
felt one that feels like

00:00:57.652 --> 00:00:59.866
its got a little bit of like,
it feels like a sweatshirt

00:00:59.866 --> 00:01:02.822
around it, but its completely
covered in this fabric

00:01:02.822 --> 00:01:03.869
which is actually kind of nice

00:01:03.869 --> 00:01:05.137
because this is something
that you're going to

00:01:05.137 --> 00:01:07.521
be using most likely on
your desk with your MacBook.

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:09.492
So, it's something that
won't slide around.

00:01:09.492 --> 00:01:12.735
Whereas some of the other Mophies,

00:01:12.735 --> 00:01:15.161
I mean, I guess they don't
really slide around either.

00:01:15.161 --> 00:01:17.544
But this slides around
way less than the others.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.507
So these are a few of my
other favorite Mophies.

00:01:19.507 --> 00:01:21.382
This one has pretty much gotten me by

00:01:21.382 --> 00:01:22.525
for the past couple of years.

00:01:22.525 --> 00:01:23.938
This is the Mophie 8X charger.

00:01:23.938 --> 00:01:25.531
This one is 15,000 milliamps

00:01:25.531 --> 00:01:27.402
and this new one is, which is interesting,

00:01:27.402 --> 00:01:30.255
because when I first read
the pre-release of this,

00:01:30.255 --> 00:01:32.359
it was like 21,000 I think.

00:01:32.359 --> 00:01:34.365
But now it looks like
its clocked at 19,500.

00:01:34.365 --> 00:01:35.830
There's a little sticker over top of it.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:38.777
So perhaps this changed in later testings.

00:01:38.777 --> 00:01:40.623
At that rate, that'll give you 14+ hours

00:01:40.623 --> 00:01:43.766
on your MacBook, 20 hours on iPad Air 2,

00:01:43.766 --> 00:01:46.212
and 100 hours on your iPhone.

00:01:46.212 --> 00:01:47.803
Something else to note is, obviously

00:01:47.803 --> 00:01:49.405
if your phone or your MacBook is off,

00:01:49.405 --> 00:01:51.067
it's going to charge
at a much faster rate.

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:53.128
So if you are desperate,
either shut your phone off,

00:01:53.128 --> 00:01:54.528
put it in airplane mode,

00:01:54.528 --> 00:01:56.563
but do shut your MacBook
off if you are desperate

00:01:56.563 --> 00:01:57.890
for a fast charge.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:01.005
It looks like we've got two
bars already on this guy.

00:02:01.005 --> 00:02:01.852
Two different ports here.

00:02:01.852 --> 00:02:04.573
We've got our USB-C and our regular USB

00:02:04.573 --> 00:02:06.047
which we're most familiar with.

00:02:06.047 --> 00:02:08.547
And here is the fabric finish.

00:02:09.617 --> 00:02:12.258
I wish that you could
touch it, but you can't.

00:02:12.258 --> 00:02:13.531
There's a little button to show how

00:02:13.531 --> 00:02:14.556
much we're charged.

00:02:14.556 --> 00:02:16.506
So I have a few other
comparison Mophies here.

00:02:16.506 --> 00:02:18.280
This is another one of their USB ones

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.384
which I've also been using quite a lot.

00:02:20.384 --> 00:02:23.134
So we have 10,000, 15,000, 3,020.

00:02:24.264 --> 00:02:26.748
I really like this line
of the power stations

00:02:26.748 --> 00:02:29.489
because they have a built-in USB cable.

00:02:29.489 --> 00:02:31.151
So we've got this little thing pops off

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:33.429
so it gives you a
USB-micro and this little

00:02:33.429 --> 00:02:35.022
converter, converts to lightning.

00:02:35.022 --> 00:02:37.079
And then it just goes right in like this.

00:02:37.079 --> 00:02:39.112
Charges through USB-micro,

00:02:39.112 --> 00:02:40.584
the only downfall of
some of the smaller ones

00:02:40.584 --> 00:02:42.573
is they don't have another USB port.

00:02:42.573 --> 00:02:44.241
So you basically have to charge it

00:02:44.241 --> 00:02:45.604
using the built-in cable.

00:02:45.604 --> 00:02:47.041
This one, I'm still in love with.

00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:49.110
Even though it's the size of an iPad Mini.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:50.360
I just like that it's super flat

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.738
so a lot of the backpacks that I have,

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:53.732
I can just kinda slide this nicely in

00:02:53.732 --> 00:02:55.262
and fit a lot of things around it.

00:02:55.262 --> 00:02:56.095
But all things considered,

00:02:56.095 --> 00:02:58.774
this one is, I mean, it is much bigger,

00:02:58.774 --> 00:03:00.113
it's also a lot thicker.

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:01.713
It's got a premium fabric wrap.

00:03:01.713 --> 00:03:03.345
That's what they're calling it.

00:03:03.345 --> 00:03:04.212
Anything else I should know?

00:03:04.212 --> 00:03:05.621
(mumbling)

00:03:05.621 --> 00:03:06.454
Guess not.

00:03:06.454 --> 00:03:07.740
This is retailing for $150,

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.259
which is about the same price as this one.

00:03:10.259 --> 00:03:13.636
Lets see what else is inside this box.

00:03:13.636 --> 00:03:15.366
We've got a USB-C to USB-C.

00:03:15.366 --> 00:03:17.949
Our basic USB to a basic USB-C.

00:03:19.276 --> 00:03:20.405
I think that's all we've got in here.

00:03:20.405 --> 00:03:21.829
But now for the real test.

00:03:21.829 --> 00:03:24.540
Will this little Mophie charge my MacBook?

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.014
Plug it in here to our USB-C.

00:03:26.014 --> 00:03:27.839
Then plug it in here.

00:03:27.839 --> 00:03:28.791
Listen for it.

00:03:28.791 --> 00:03:30.247
(beep)

00:03:30.247 --> 00:03:31.605
Do you know what that sound is?

00:03:31.605 --> 00:03:34.510
That sound means, oh baby, we're charging.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.522
And I'm happy about it.

00:03:35.522 --> 00:03:37.165
I feel like this is
going to be a great thing

00:03:37.165 --> 00:03:40.109
for planes, for traveling, in the car.

00:03:40.109 --> 00:03:42.031
One of the things that
I'm going to be curious is

00:03:42.031 --> 00:03:43.968
to see how much a full battery of this

00:03:43.968 --> 00:03:45.353
will actually charge my MacBook.

00:03:45.353 --> 00:03:46.731
So I will try that out

00:03:46.731 --> 00:03:48.433
and give you maybe guys
an update on Twitter,

00:03:48.433 --> 00:03:50.763
or Instagram, or wherever
it is that you follow me.

00:03:50.763 --> 00:03:53.314
That that information may
be easy to get across.

00:03:53.314 --> 00:03:54.572
Or maybe even in a vlog.

00:03:54.572 --> 00:03:55.509
Who knows?

00:03:55.509 --> 00:03:57.720
This thing is pretty cool and
I'm super excited about it.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.174
I'm not sure how I feel about the fabric.

00:03:59.174 --> 00:04:01.773
It's very different than
all of the previous models.

00:04:01.773 --> 00:04:06.498
But what I will say, is it
looks really, really good.

00:04:06.498 --> 00:04:08.035
Like, look how nice this looks.

00:04:08.035 --> 00:04:08.868
It's incredible.

00:04:08.868 --> 00:04:10.742
Great work Mophie. Let me
know what you guys think.

00:04:10.742 --> 00:04:13.442
What battery chargers do you
use for your external devices?

00:04:13.442 --> 00:04:14.728
I would love to know.

00:04:14.728 --> 00:04:16.255
And let me know how many milliamps it is.

00:04:16.255 --> 00:04:17.628
And if you're not sure where to find that,

00:04:17.628 --> 00:04:19.205
most of them just say on the back

00:04:19.205 --> 00:04:21.374
where the small, little,
tiny, fine text is.

00:04:21.374 --> 00:04:22.834
I'll see you guys on my next video.

00:04:22.834 --> 00:04:23.667
Bye.

00:04:23.667 --> 00:04:26.250
(upbeat music)

